          - ::
            type: "heading"
            content: "Forms & Submissions"
            css: "color: #1a202c; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 30px;"

          - ::
            type: "markdown-text"
            mode: "markdown"
            content: "## Overview\n\nSthalam enables publishers to collect viewer feedback through multiple independent forms embedded in websites. Using the append-only permission model (`crud/append`), viewers can submit form data without seeing other viewers' submissions, preserving privacy.\n\n## How It Works\n\n### Viewer Experience\n\n1. **Opening Website**: Forms render instantly from local copy\n2. **Filling Form**: Interactive fields with validation\n3. **Submitting**: Data sent to sovereign node with append-only permission\n\n### Permission Model: `crud/append`\n\nThe viewer's UCAN token contains append-only access:\n- ✅ **Can append** new records to the document\n- ❌ **Cannot read** existing submissions\n- ❌ **Cannot update** existing submissions\n- ❌ **Cannot delete** submissions\n\n### Privacy Benefits\n\n**Viewers Cannot See Other Submissions**:\n- Each viewer only knows their own submission\n- No cross-viewer data leakage\n- Privacy preserved by permission model\n\n**Publisher Access**:\n- Publisher has full `crud/read` permission\n- Can view all submissions\n- Can export and analyze data\n- Full ownership and control\n\n## Data Structure\n\nForms are organized by `form_id`:\n\n```javascript\n{\n  forms: {\n    \"contact_form\": [\n      { id: \"s1\", fields: {...}, timestamp: ... },\n      { id: \"s2\", fields: {...}, timestamp: ... }\n    ],\n    \"feedback_form\": [\n      { id: \"s3\", fields: {...}, timestamp: ... }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Use Cases\n\n### Contact Forms\nCollect messages from website visitors with privacy preservation.\n\n### Surveys & Polls\nGather feedback without exposing individual responses to other viewers.\n\n### Event Registration\nCollect RSVPs and attendee information privately.\n\n### Bug Reports\nOrganized feedback collection from users.\n\n## Security\n\n- **Encryption**: AES-256-GCM at rest and in transit\n- **Spam Prevention**: Rate limiting on node side\n- **Data Validation**: UCAN token validation\n- **Privacy Compliance**: Viewers cannot access others' data"
