            css: "color: #1a202c; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 30px;"

          - ::
            type: "markdown-text"
            mode: "markdown"
            content: "## What is Livnote?\n\nLivnote is a peer-to-peer collaborative note-taking application that enables real-time synchronization between peers without requiring a central server.\n\n## Key Features\n\n### Self-Sovereign Identity\nCreate and manage your cryptographic identity:\n- **PGP Keypair**: For encryption and authentication\n- **Ed25519 Keys**: For signing and verification\n- **UCAN Keys**: For authorization and permissions\n\n### Peer-to-Peer Collaboration\nConnect directly with other users:\n- **Direct Connections**: No central server required\n- **Real-time Sync**: CRDT-based synchronization\n- **Offline-First**: Works without internet connectivity\n\n### Resource Management\nOrganize your notes and documents:\n- **Folders**: Hierarchical organization\n- **Sharing**: Selective sharing with peers\n- **Permissions**: Fine-grained access control\n\n### Live Editing\nCollaborate in real-time:\n- **Simultaneous Editing**: Multiple users editing together\n- **Conflict Resolution**: Automatic CRDT-based merging\n- **Presence Awareness**: See who's currently editing\n\n## Getting Started\n\n1. **Create Your Identity**: Generate your cryptographic keys\n2. **Connect to Peers**: Exchange connection credentials\n3. **Create Resources**: Start taking notes and creating documents\n4. **Share**: Distribute content with peers securely\n\n## Technical Foundation\n\n- **CRDTs**: Conflict-free Replicated Data Types for synchronization\n- **End-to-End Encryption**: All content encrypted with AES-256-GCM\n- **P2P Networking**: Direct peer connections via libp2p/QUIC\n- **Local-First**: Instant performance with background sync"
